    "fabricante": "Lunagen"
  },

  // ---------------- air moved on purpose (crates/ship/src/airworks.rs, docs/AIRE.md) ----------------
  // a hand valve through a bulkhead 6 cm thick (its origin in the middle of the wall, +z the way
  // from its first compartment to its second): the valve itself in the wall and, on each side,
  // a plate that carries its wheel and the gauge of the pressure across it (the panel `airworks`
  // makes for it; the wheels of both sides are one). "boca": where its air comes out
